{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07712","headline":"山中逢道士云公 · 孟浩然","name":"山中逢道士云公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春余草木繁，耕种满田园。\n酌酒聊自劝，农夫安与言。\n忽闻荆山子，时出桃花源。\n采樵过北谷，卖药来西村。\n村烟日云夕，榛路有归客。\n杖策前相逢，依然是畴昔。\n邂逅欢觏止，殷勤叙离隔。\n谓予搏扶桑，轻举振六翮。\n奈何偶昌运，独见遗草泽。\n既笑接舆狂，仍怜孔丘厄。\n物情趋势利，吾道贵闲寂。\n偃息西山下，门庭罕人迹。\n何时还清溪，从尔链丹液。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}